Hash: message digests and HMAC (hash, hash_hmac, hash_file: MD5,
SHA-1, SHA-2, RIPEMD, Whirlpool, CRC32 and others) and the mhash
functions on them. A module in PHP 5.6 (a part of the core from PHP
7.4); phar needs it.

The module hash of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/hash.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/hash.
